{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "世", "id": "世"}, {"form": "中", "id": "中"}, {"form": "亂", "id": "亂"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "周", "id": "周"}, {"form": "往", "id": "往"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "恐", "id": "恐"}, {"form": "戰", "id": "戰"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "追", "id": "追"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.777773227253315, "source": "亂", "target": "世"}, {"weight": 1.777773227253315, "source": "亂", "target": "周"}, {"weight": 1.6236225474260568, "source": "亂", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 2.1832383353614797, "source": "亂", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.9600947840472698, "source": "亂", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.8763855159214247, "source": "亂", "target": "恐"}, {"weight": 2.7586024802650413, "source": "周", "target": "世"}, {"weight": 2.6044518004377832, "source": "周", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 2.4709204078132605, "source": "周", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 3.164067588373206, "source": "周", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.4709204078132605, "source": "周", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 3.164067588373206, "source": "往", "target": "追"}, {"weight": 2.247776856499051, "source": "往", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.2669476034873244, "source": "至", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.1832383353614797, "source": "至", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 1.6236225474260568, "source": "至", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 2.8763855159214247, "source": "至", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.9113046198778376, "source": "世", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 2.247776856499051, "source": "義", 